{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"2019","title":"Xiaomi Unveils New AIoT Product Offerings","desc":"Releasing five new pieces of tech spanning home entertainment, cooking, and daily commutes","view_cnt":"1391","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1627370613","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/211_operatorx_operatorx_opx/27/07/2021/25d917372a720f909508901751a5a134.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eReleasing five new pieces of tech spanning home entertainment, cooking, and daily commutes\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eBeijing, CHINA, July 26, 2021– Xiaomi today unveiled a range of AIoT products that enhance smart experiences for every facet of users’ lives. The brand-new lineups of products include Mi Router AX9000, Mi 2K Gaming Monitor 27’’, Mi Electric Scooter 3, Redmi Buds 3 Pro, and Mi Smart Air Fryer 3.5L.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eThese products are innovative in their own right and offer smarter ways to encourage users to be active outdoors, or enhance their lifestyle indoors, whether they are on their way to work, at the desk, or fixing up a quick meal in the kitchen. Through these innovative technologies, Xiaomi delivers a more convenient, efficient, and healthier lifestyle to every individual, making smart living for everyone possible.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003ePower Your Smart Life with Strong Connectivity\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003eMi Router AX9000: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eDesigned for the hyper-connected future home, and as a hub for users’ digital entertainment, the newly released Mi Router AX9000 is Xiaomi’s first Tri-Band WI-FI 6 router\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup style=\"color: black;\"\u003e1\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e equipped with a Qualcomm® Hexa-core processor. With one 4GHZ and two 5GHZ bands, this flagship product is capable of providing uninterrupted gaming experiences even when it is powering multiple connected smart devices simultaneously.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eReaching speeds of up to 8,354Mbps\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup style=\"color: black;\"\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e, Mi Router AX9000 checks off all the boxes a modern-day gamer or smart homeowner needs in a high-end router, enabling high-bandwidth gaming or downloads while enabling them to simultaneously live stream in 4K without stuttering. Built into the Mi Router AX9000 is a dedicated AIoT antenna that allows users to simply connect and manage their network of smart devices in just a few taps.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003eMi 2K Gaming Monitor 27\":\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e We didn't stop there and doubled down in a big way that gamers will love. Xiaomi's all-new Mi 2K Gaming Monitor 27’’, presents every detail sharply on a 2560 x 1440 QHD screen and with a silky smooth 165Hz high refresh rate that'll be sure to immerse gamers or even offer an edge in-game. Mi 2K Gaming Monitor 27’’ also supports VESA Display™ 400 and 95% of the DCI-P3 color range, making for a bright and vibrant display that can project stunning gaming graphics and even professional visual content.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003eEmbrace a Smarter, Healthier Style of Cooking\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003eMi Smart Air Fryer 3.5L: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eA smart lifestyle starts within the kitchen, Mi Smart Air Fryer 3.5L caters to those of us that live busy lives but won’t compromise on our commitment to a healthier lifestyle, by making cooking at home simple and healthy - all without adding oil. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eCompatible with the Mi Home app, the fryer can easily be controlled remotely and can be set to anywhere between 40°C and 200°C for a perfectly cooked meal. The app also offers more than 100 different Mi Smart Air Fryer 3.5L recipe ideas for quick meal inspirations every day\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup style=\"color: black;\"\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eWith Mi Smart Air Fryer 3.5L, users can even schedule a cooked meal up to 24 hours in advance. This opens the doors to endless cooking possibilities, be it yogurt fermentation, pet food dehydration. If your hands are tied, voice commands powered by Google Assistant can start, pause, or check the remaining cooking time\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup style=\"color: black;\"\u003e4\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e. The clear OLED display also lets you glance at the time and temperature.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003eElevate Your On-the-Go Style\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003eMi Electric Scooter 3: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eXiaomi’s solutions enhance both the lives we live indoors, but also beyond the walls of our homes as well. In fact, Xiaomi has led first and last-mile mobility with more than 4,000,000 Xiaomi Mi Electric Scooters shipped globally\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup style=\"color: black;\"\u003e5\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eThe newly released Mi Electric Scooter 3 is another stylish urban companion for commuters to get around town with further improved user experience and safety features. It comes with two colors to choose from including Onyx Black and Gravity Grey. It also features a highly practical lightweight body as well as an upgraded 3-step folding design, making it comfortable to carry or simply fold it up and store it away in the back of a car or on a bus or train.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eClocking in at up to 25km/h on a 600W maximum power motor, Mi Electric Scooter 3 easily glides over slopes or bumps throughout your short trips around the city. But it also comes with new safety features. This includes an E-ABS regenerative anti-lock braking system and a new rear dual-pad disc brake.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003eRedmi Buds 3 Pro:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e Along with the scooter, Redmi Buds 3 Pro is also a perfect companion to keep you entertained or plugged in on the road. The product features an immersive sound experience with hybrid ANC and transparency modes\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup style=\"color: black;\"\u003e6\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e. It also supports Bluetooth 5.2 for stable dual-device connectivity, meaning users can effortlessly switch from watching a video on their laptop to picking up a call on their smartphone, all without having to re-pair the devices.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eWhen users are on the go, Redmi Buds 3 Pro offers up to 6 hours of use from the earbuds alone or gets up to 28 hours of total playback time when charged inside of the case. In only a 10 minutes charge within the case, users have enough power for up to 3 hours of music playback\u003c/span\u003e\u003csup style=\"color: black;\"\u003e7\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e. Redmi Buds 3 Pro also supports wireless charging, letting users live that cable-free life.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePricing \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi Router AX9000 recommended retail price starts from 299€\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 2K Gaming Monitor 27'' recommended retail price starts from 499€\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRedmi Buds 3 Pro recommended retail price starts from 69.9€\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi Electric Scooter 3 recommended retail price starts from 449€\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi Smart Air Fryer 3.5L recommended retail price starts from 99€\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct available channels and timeline, please refer to the mi.com page in your region.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDetailed product specs and product images, please download from here: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://miretail-my.sharepoint.com/:f:/g/personal/wangyanqiao_xiaomi_com/Et33FVAQuH5GhwNmVEqM1AwBOvnjWjo7KZhoCnv6uotaXA?e=sHdUyK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePress Toolkit\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cem\u003e1\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cem\u003eTo enable Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and features including OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and 4K QAM/1024QAM require end devices also support the corresponding features. Actual wireless rate may vary between actual network conditions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cem\u003e2\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cem\u003eMaximum wireless transmission rates are the physical rates derived from IEEE Standard 802.11 specifications.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cem\u003e3\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cem\u003eMore recipes to be available via OTA.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cem\u003e4\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cem\u003eGoogle Assistant and Amazon Alexa availability may vary between markets. Update firmware to the latest version for voice control features. Google Assistant is the trademark of Google LLC.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cem\u003e5\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cem\u003eAs of Jun 2021, Xiaomi internal data.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cem\u003e6\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cem\u003eCertain ANC and transparency mode settings available only on selected Xiaomi/Redmi smartphones. \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cem\u003e7\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cem\u003eData acquired from internal labs, actual battery life may vary based on actual usage.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003ca href=\"http://1810.hk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/a\u003e). Xiaomi is an internet company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an Internet of Things (IoT) platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith an equal emphasis on innovation and quality, Xiaomi continuously pursues high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs of the second quarter of 2021, Xiaomi is the no.2 smartphone brand in the global smartphone market. The company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, with 351.1 million smart devices connected to its platform, excluding smartphones and laptops. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2020, the company made the Fortune Global 500 list for the second time, ranking 422nd, up 46 places compared to 2019. It also ranked 7th among internet companies.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"25","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1627370394"},"common":null}